& [SJS]
  + Situation: Slice4B1 can compile and replay lexical postings but no user or program can yet ask that sidecar which admitted meanings correspond to ordinary text
  + Justification: one lexical-only lookup waist can prove deterministic budgeted retrieval and exact source evidence without prematurely coupling semantic gates scanner pagination or an LLM
  + Solution: activate a distinct lookup request result and CLI laboratory that rebuilds all signed semantic artifacts in memory then returns complete ordered proof-bearing lexical observations

& [ConflictResolved]
  + full Slice4B2 readiness recommends exact-channel suppression purpose boundary authority lifecycle applicability relation integration and lexical cursor identity
  + implementing all behavior together would enlarge the prototype and modify exact-scanner composition before the retrieval waist is directly testable
  + Slice4B2A therefore performs lexical observation only and explicitly reports that semantic-purpose gates did not run
  + the existing exact scanner and published cantor query CLI remain unchanged rollback and comparison surfaces

& [FormDecision]
  + request keeps ordered original terms rather than only a set so input duplication remains inspectable
  + each term account stores exact sorted token occurrence counts while the result separately stores the unique eligible token union
  + matched evidence removes the repeated address but retains posting token surface kind digest occurrence and exact evidence identities
  + each match owns one full SemanticAddress one matched-token set one evidence vector and exact coverage basis points
  + result binds catalogue fabric index tokenizer request accounts tokens postings matches non-authority statement and proof digest

& [BudgetDecision]
  + hard caps are 128 terms 65536 total term bytes 4096 unique tokens 131072 postings 4096 matches and 67108864 serialized result bytes
  + CLI defaults are 16384 postings and 256 matches with all other limits fixed conservatively
  + complete posting cardinality is known and checked before match aggregation
  + match overflow refuses rather than clips because Slice4B2A defines no cursor and partial discovery could distort coverage and ambiguity

& [OrderingAndCoverage]
  + coverage uses matched unique eligible tokens only and floor checked integer basis-point arithmetic
  + evidence multiplicity occurrence alias preferred and meaning surface distinctions retain provenance but add no numeric weight
  + ordered results use coverage descending then complete deterministic address identity
  + an equal coverage tie remains multiple visible matches and the lab selects no winner

& [CLISeam]
  + a new cantor-anchor-lab binary reads only an explicit environment path and one explicit text value
  + it uses the existing EmbeddedRuntimeEnvironment TrustStore certificates admit_package SemanticFabric catalogue and index derivation functions
  + its success envelope exposes environment digest and result while its fault envelope exposes bounded stage kind and detail
  + it creates no files and invokes no model service network or remote host

& [TestDecision]
  + core fixtures cover exact lookup ambiguity multi-token coverage repeated evidence substring exclusion missing tokens empty tokens budgets order roots proof and whole replay
  + CLI integration reuses the tracked self-hosted corpus build fixture and its temporary signed environment then requires repeated byte-identical lookup output with exact sources
  + malformed arguments swapped profiles budget excess and environment trust failure refuse
  + debug release workspace warnings-denied format evidence diff and unchanged-scanner identity close the slice

& [FacultyReview]
  + Honesty preserves lexical-only status originals unmatched terms ambiguity coverage formula and non-authority statement
  + Security performs signed admission whole sidecar replay hard budgets no partial response and read-only local process bounds
  + Weaver joins terms tokens postings surfaces evidence and addresses without synonym or relation invention
  + Planner keeps admission derivation cardinality aggregation ordering result closure and replay in dependency order
  + Refiner isolates the smallest useful lookup and avoids exact-scanner churn
  + Scribe records every governing root token surface source request result and fault identity
  + Observer requires deterministic core CLI and workspace closure before consuming authority

& [Disposition]
